{"cluster_id": "C-1880", "topic": "Under the current Stage-A posture, Gc", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B046-031", "B049-075", "B050-097"], "canonical_claim": "Under the current Stage-A posture, Gc::runNamespaceJanitorPage passes the suppression flag to NamespaceJanitor::runOnePage, which visits unresolved physical life keys but skips every deleteExact when deletes are suppressed; canonical dead-life residue therefore remains pending until destructive rounds are enabled.; The folding path passes its `FoldResult::suppress_destructive` verdict to the janitor helper, while `DEFER` calls the same helper with deletion suppressed because it has no complete fold verdict.; During Stage-A destruction suppression, the janitor withholds `deleteExact`; its `namespace_cleanup` metrics record seen keys and a `suppressed` count, so six rounds with zero deletions do not prove permanent orphaning.", "issue_ids": ["T3", "T6"], "sources": [".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/t3-report.md#L141-L159", ".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/unattended-log.md#L457-L476", ".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/unattended-log.md#L499-L503", ".superpowers/sdd/task-5-step8-cpp-report.md#implemented-contract"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-1881", "topic": "parseNamespaceFileKey now throws on dirty _files keys", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B046-035", "B049-079"], "canonical_claim": "parseNamespaceFileKey now throws on dirty _files keys; NamespaceJanitor::runOnePage catches the exception, records an anomaly, and advances the cursor without clearing page_decided, so malformed keys do not wedge the janitor.; The namespace janitor retains current `Creating`, `Live`, and `Removing` life identifiers through the catalog reverse index; an absent identifier is a deletion candidate, duplicate current identifiers suppress the whole page, and malformed keys are reported and skipped.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": [".superpowers/sdd/2026-07-28-cas-ref-chain-stage-b-catalog/task-5-step8-report.md#task-5-step-8-perpetual-namespace-janitor", ".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/t3-review.md#L192-L199"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-1882", "topic": "A rejected precommit body can be nominated and physically swept through ", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B031-083", "B046-039"], "canonical_claim": "A rejected precommit body can be nominated and physically swept through real Gc::runRegularRoundReclaiming rounds after successor recovery closes the dead epoch with an arithmetic seal; genuine rejection means ChunkFaultBackend::Mode::Unresolved throws before CountingBackend::putIfAbsent.; Physical unreachable bodies from `Rejected`, `Uncertain`, and `Durable` attempts remain GC/orphan-sweep-owned; the writer path never exact-deletes a body, and missing attribution suppresses destructive fallback.", "issue_ids": ["Q-1"], "sources": [".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/t4-report.md#L57-L71", ".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/t4-review.md#L135-L153", "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining.md#t4"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-1883", "topic": "The production default UniversePolicy", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["AUDIT-M-092", "B046-040"], "canonical_claim": "The production default UniversePolicy::kDefault is StageA_Suppressed; a suppressed runRegularRound() does not call planManifestCursorPage, emits an orphan_sweep phase with listed == 0, deleted == 0, and suppressed == 1, and leaves the candidate manifest intact.; Under `suppress_destructive`, both the `manifest_deletes` phase and the orphan sweep are gated closed: `mf_cleanup_now` is an empty map, and the orphan-sweep delete loop consumes `folded.orphan_sweep.nominations`, which is empty because `planManifestCursorPage` is only invoked when `!suppress_destructive`.", "issue_ids": ["T6"], "sources": [".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/t4-report.md#L72-L80", ".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/t4-review.md#L155-L168", ".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/t6-report.md#L94-L101"]}
